	Full NLM / JATS 2.x article. Uses every feature the built-in NLM stylesheet
	(transform/nlm/nlm-xhtml.xsl) renders, plus every kind of file reference
	that the plugin rewrites to a dependent-file URL.

	Dependent files to upload with this galley (examples/dependent-files/):
	  figure1.png      -> <graphic> plain name
	  figure 2.png     -> <graphic> name with a space, and URL-encoded name
	  figure3.png      -> referenced with a folder prefix: images/figure3.png
	  data.csv         -> <supplementary-material>
	  appendix.pdf     -> <inline-supplementary-material>
	  style.css        -> linked automatically in <head>
	Not uploaded on purpose: missing.png (reference must stay unchanged).
-->
